WEBVTT

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:01.070
and transformed
into a very stable form of carbon.

00:04:01.946 --> 00:04:04.031
It looks like charcoal powder.

00:04:04.657 --> 00:04:07.910
The first amazing property of biochar

00:04:07.952 --> 00:04:11.998
is that it remains stable
for hundreds of years,

00:04:11.998 --> 00:04:13.749
even if put in the soil,

00:04:13.749 --> 00:04:16.002
where biomass will normally degrade.

00:04:16.585 --> 00:04:17.753
Think about it.

00:04:18.587 --> 00:04:23.009
The CO2 captured by plants
through photosynthesis

00:04:23.009 --> 00:04:25.261
and converted into biochar

00:04:25.261 --> 00:04:28.806
stays in the soil, and so stays away
from the atmosphere,

00:04:28.806 --> 00:04:30.266
for hundreds of years.